        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Golden State Warriors, National Basketball Association, Boston Celtics, Cleveland Cavaliers, St. John's Red Storm\n- People: Chris Mullin, Danny Fortson, Bob Sura\n- Events: 2000–01 Golden State Warriors season, 2000–01 NBA season, offseason\n- Places: San Francisco Bay Area\n- Roles: forward, head coach, professional basketball player\n\nFacts:\n- Chris Mullin was born on July 30, 1963.\n- Chris Mullin is an American retired professional basketball player and the current head coach of the St. John's Red Storm.\n- The 2000–01 NBA season was the Golden State Warriors' 55th season in the National Basketball Association and their 39th season in the San Francisco Bay Area.\n- During the 2000–01 Golden State Warriors offseason, the Warriors re-signed free agent and former All-Star forward Chris Mullin.\n- During the same offseason, the Golden State Warriors acquired Danny Fortson from the Boston Celtics and Bob Sura from the Cleveland Cavaliers.",
